## 3. Verification Results

### Automatic Testing
- **Unit Tests**: Created for critical financial modules (`TaxService`) and risk modules (`FraudEngine`).
- **CI/CD**: GitHub Actions pipeline defined in [.github/workflows/deploy.yml](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/.github/workflows/deploy.yml).

### Cart & Notifications
- ✅ **Global Feedback**: Added a global "Toast" notification system that triggers whenever an item is added to or removed from the cart.
- ✅ **Removal Alerts**: Implemented specific feedback for item removal (including quantity reductions to zero) with a distinct visual style (orange/trash icon).
- ✅ **Smooth Animations**: Implemented slide-up transitions for a premium feel.
- ✅ **Context Awareness**: Integrated directly into [CartContext](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/context/CartContext.tsx#14-26), meaning it works automatically for all products in all stores.

### Data Enrichment
- ✅ **Product Expansion**: Added 110+ new mock products across all 11 stores.
- ✅ **Category Specific**: Each store now has a full catalog of 10+ items relevant to its category (e.g., bulk office supplies for Costco, artisan bread for The Daily Loaf).
- ✅ **Consistent Data**: Every new product includes a unique ID, price, category, and high-quality image URL.

### Manual Validation Walkthrough

#### A. Consumer Shopping Flow (Enhanced)
1. - **Registration**: Separate flows for Shoppers (Address) and Merchants (Store Name).
2.  **Browsing**: [StoreList](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/consumer/StoreList.tsx#24-182) -> Click Store -> [StoreDetail](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/consumer/StoreDetail.tsx#435-661) shows inventory.
3.  **Cart**: "Add to Cart" persists items globally via [CartContext](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/context/CartContext.tsx#14-26).
4.  **Optimization**: `SmartCartEngine` runs in background to suggest splits.

#### B. Merchant Onboarding & Ops
1. **Sign Up**: [MerchantLayout](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/layouts/MerchantLayout.tsx#6-94) protects route.
2. **Product Mgmt**: Merchant adds inventory via [ProductManager.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/merchant/ProductManager.tsx).
3. **Order Mgmt**: Merchant accepts order in [OrderManager.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/merchant/OrderManager.tsx), satisfying State Machine rules.

#### C. Admin & Compliance
1. **Safety**: Admin uses [UserManagement.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/admin/UserManagement.tsx) to ban bad actors.
2. **Audit**: [AuditLogs.tsx](file:///Users/shahbaz/Documents/Spendigo/apps/web/src/pages/admin/AuditLogs.tsx) provides immutable record of financial events.
